title: Easter Saturday at Krupp
subtitle: French soldiers fire on the workers in Essen.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month = 3
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.news('French soldiers kill thirteen workers at Krupp', 3);
RG.district('ruhr', {militancy: 8});
!}

= Easter Saturday at Krupp

On 31 March a French detachment comes to requisition lorries at the Krupp works in Essen. The sirens sound and thousands of workers pour into the yard. A lieutenant panics and his men open fire. Thirteen workers are killed. The French then arrest Gustav Krupp von Bohlen, as though the owner had ordered his own men shot.

The funeral will be the largest the Ruhr has seen. The nationalists want it for themselves.

- @funeral: March behind the coffins with the unions.
- @strike: Call the Ruhr out.
- @french: Ask a French communist to speak at the graves.

@funeral
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Our banners among the nation's.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids a common march with the reformist unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('united_front');
RG.district('ruhr', {members: 0.04, loyalty: 3});
Q.e23_krupp = 1;
Q.worker_support += 3;
